<title>SPAIN: Spain October PPI rose 0.3 pct, yr-yr up 1.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain October PPI rose 0.3 pct, yr-yr up 1.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute</p>
<p>gave the following figures:</p>
<p> PRODUCER PRICES		   Oct 96	Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Pct change on month		0.3	   0.3	   -0.2</p>
<p> Pct change on year		 1.3	   0.8	    5.9</p>
<p>The INE gave the following breakdown (percentage change)</p>
<p>					   OCT 96   SEPT 96   OCT 96/95</p>
<p> Energy				    2.7	1.4	6.4</p>
<p> Non-energy minerals, chemicals    0.4	0.0     -3.1</p>
<p> Metals, precision tools	     0.0	0.1	2.4</p>
<p> Other manufacturing		  -0.1	0.1	1.1</p>
<p> Consumer goods			 -0.1	0.2	3.1</p>
<p> Capital goods			   0.1	0.0	2.1</p>
<p> Intermediary goods		    0.9	0.3     -0.7</p>
</text>
